LangString LANGNAME_NeedAdminRights ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This installer is not running with administrator rights, so it cannot write to the programs folder. Only portable-mode installation will work. To install under Program Files, close setup and run it again as administrator (or approve the UAC prompt)."
LangString LANGNAME_NeedAdminRightsUpdate ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This installer is not running with administrator rights, so it cannot write to the programs folder. Only portable (USB stick) installations can be updated. To update a Program Files install, close setup and run it again as administrator (or approve the UAC prompt)."

LangString LANGNAME_WelcomeText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This wizard will guide you through the installation of ${PrgName}.\r\n\r\nDFendX is open source software and licensed unter the GPL 3 license. (You can view the license by clicking Help|About in the program.) DFendX comes without any guarantee or warranty.\r\n\r\nClick Next to continue."
LangString LANGNAME_WelcomeTextUpdate ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This wizard will guide you through the update installation of ${PrgName}.\r\n\r\nThis installer requires an existing DFendX installation !\r\n\r\nClick Next to continue."
